      "updated": 1781004705880,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User can log new/remove tasks/appointments and set them to completed.\nBe notified of nearing deadlines/meetings/time\nDay of week, week number, month and year would be great!\n",
      "fontSize": 9.028829020432955,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User can log new/remove tasks/appointments and set them to completed.\nBe notified of nearing deadlines/meetings/time\nDay of week, week number, month and year would be great!\n",
